### ==============================================================================
### OXIDE Bot Monitor & Centralized Order Tracking Service - REST API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Overview Dashboard Summary (Online, Active, Standby, In Progress, Kill-Switch)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/overview

### 3. Get Global Kill-Switch Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/kill-switch

### 4. Enable System (Kill-Switch: OFF / Active Accepting Orders)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/kill-switch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "actor": "admin"
}

### 5. Disable System (Kill-Switch: ON / Rejecting Orders)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/kill-switch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false,
  "actor": "admin"
}

### 6. Get Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/audit-logs

### ==============================================================================
### Bot Fleet Management & Commands
### ==============================================================================

### 7. List All Bot Agents (5 Nodes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bots

### 8. Get Specific Bot Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bots/bot-02

### 9. Send Start Command to Bot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bots/bot-02/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "start",
  "requestedBy": "admin"
}

### 10. Send Stop Command to Bot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bots/bot-02/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "stop",
  "requestedBy": "admin"
}

### 11. Send Restart Command to Bot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bots/bot-02/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "restart",
  "requestedBy": "admin"
}

### 12. Ingest Bot Heartbeat Telemetry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bots/bot-02/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpu": 12.8,
  "memory": 36.4,
  "uptime": 14200,
  "status": "online"
}

### 13. Trigger Heartbeat Timeout Watchdog Check
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bots/watchdog/check

### ==============================================================================
### Code Deployment & Release Packaging
### ==============================================================================

### 14. List Available Packages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments/packages

### 15. Create / Pack New Bot Code Release
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments/packages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customName": "oxide-2026-09-17T15-48-05"
}

### 16. Deploy Package to All Bot Machines
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments/deploy-all
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deployed_by": "admin"
}

### 17. Deploy Package to Single Bot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments/deploy-bot/bot-01
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deployed_by": "admin"
}

### ==============================================================================
### Order Tracking & State Machine
### ==============================================================================

### 18. List Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders

### 19. Create New Order (Pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_order_id": "ORD-LIVE-001",
  "amount": 990,
  "currency": "THB"
}

### 20. Dispatch Order to Bot (Fails if Kill-Switch is OFF!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/1/dispatch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "botId": "bot-02"
}

### 21. Complete Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/1/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "botId": "bot-02",
  "result": {
    "transactionId": "TX-WEB-9912",
    "notes": "TOPUP SUCCESS"
  }
}
